Cell["\<\
projection acts on a site's internal degrees of freedom, such as spin. Use \
{{1.}} for a scalar orbital.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1431037366,ExpressionUUID->"54b2525f-10a3-184a-9f31-2a5c9c9c6443"],

Cell["\<\
lastColumnGreens is the reverse-ordered final column returned by \
CentralBlockGreens[..., \"LDOS\"].\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->270119194,ExpressionUUID->"5c1eef62-0dec-1d47-9a37-43e27407a9ca"],

Cell["\<\
layeredPoints is an Association of layer keys to site coordinates in original \
layer order. Results append a density to each coordinate.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->995635465,ExpressionUUID->"537bcbac-b0bf-ae4a-bf10-da8c6326f2de"],

Cell["\<\
Uses G gamma G\[Dagger]/(2 Pi) with gamma from the supplied contacts. At \
finite artificial broadening this is the contact-induced spectral density, \
not the full -Im[G]/Pi density.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1574664842,ExpressionUUID->"a06e4215-e91a-bd4e-ab22-c9874effc013"]
}, Closed]],

